## Security+ Exam Notes

- Change management reduces operational and security risks.
- CAB = Change Advisory Board.
- A change request documents proposed modifications.
- Testing helps prevent production failures.
- Rollback plans provide a recovery option.
- Unauthorized changes can introduce vulnerabilities.
- Documentation provides accountability and audit evidence.

